smartXchange is proud to have entered its fourth month since launching with now over 130 users!
This past month we have added user settings where you can update your settings,
for example changing from active mode to stealth mode (where no one can see that you're active).
We have improved search so you can search by language and level such as 'english a1 a2'
or by keyword such as 'spanish teacher' and you can search from the Chrome address bar.
We have updated notifications so you will be emailed anytime someone sends a message or starts a conversation with you.
We have made location editable so you can now enter any city, country or landmark and our algorithm will try to find others close by.
We have added reviews to be completed if you have exchanged more than 100 messages with someone else.
And lastly, we have added boards for each language, subdivided by category, and one board for smart jobs.
